  "summary": "Malicious code in farplotx (npm)",
  "details": "Farplotx ships compiled binaries (bin/cli, bin/cli-linux-amd64, bin/cli-http-linux) instead of the declared JavaScript entry point. The Go binary contains a hardcoded beacon endpoint catcher1[.]corraldev[.]com:8084 and the package README instructs the user to run the binary once to \"activate the package in our systems,\" causing the binary to phone home to that host when executed.",
